{"id":1576,"date":"2023-02-21T05:27:14","date_gmt":"2023-02-21T12:27:14","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/citruscapital.ca\/?page_id=1576"},"modified":"2026-06-22T18:01:41","modified_gmt":"2026-06-23T00:01:41","slug":"accounting-bookkeeping","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/citruscapital.ca\/accounting-bookkeeping\/","title":{"rendered":"Accounting &#038; Bookkeeping"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"1576\" class=\"elementor elementor-1576\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-ekjheoq elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"ekjheoq\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-25748b2d\" data-id=\"25748b2d\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-253d822f elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"253d822f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Accounting &amp; Bookkeeping<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1dca66c4 elementor-widget-divider--view-line elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"1dca66c4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-027966b elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"027966b\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-371afdd\" data-id=\"371afdd\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-572da7c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"572da7c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><em>So you can run the business, not reconcile it.<\/em><\/p>\n\n<p>Whether you&#8217;re running a boutique, a restaurant, a construction company, or a professional services firm: your books need to be clean, current, and readable. We&#8217;ve worked with businesses across all industries and all sizes. Our clients don&#8217;t manage their own books, because they know their time is better spent running their business. They make data-informed decisions based on up-to-date, timely financial information.<\/p>\n\n<h3>Bookkeeping Services<\/h3>\n<p>The operational foundation of your finances: keeping your records accurate, current, and organized.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Transaction categorization and reconciliation<\/li>\n<li>Payroll processing and reporting<\/li>\n<li>Accounts payable and receivable management<\/li>\n<li>Month-end and year-end close<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n<h3>Accounting Services<\/h3>\n<p>The reporting layer: preparing and presenting your financial picture accurately and completely.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Financial statement preparation (income statement, balance sheet, cash flow)<\/li>\n<li>Audit preparation<\/li>\n<li>Year-end working paper preparation<\/li>\n<li>Chart of accounts setup and maintenance<\/li>\n<li>Fixed asset tracking and depreciation schedules<\/li>\n<li>GST\/HST filing and compliance<\/li>\n<li>Management reporting packages<\/li>\n<li>Bank reconciliations<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n<h3>There are two kinds of business owners.<\/h3>\n<p>Those whose books are always a few months behind: scrambled together when someone asks for them. And those whose numbers are always current, always clean, and ready to inform the next decision. The difference isn&#8217;t the size of the business. It&#8217;s whether someone owns the books or not.<\/p>\n\n<h3>Personal service, every time.<\/h3>\n<p>At Citrus, every client has a direct, ongoing relationship with their account manager: someone who knows your business, knows your numbers, and is reachable when you need them. That&#8217;s not a feature. It&#8217;s how we work.<\/p>\n\n<h3>Limited availability each quarter.<\/h3>\n<p>We onboard new bookkeeping and accounting clients on a rolling quarterly basis: with limited spots available each quarter to ensure every transition is handled properly and every client receives the attention they deserve from day one. Reach out to check current availability.<\/p>\n\n<p><strong>Get Started.<\/strong> Book a free 20-minute call to talk through your needs.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e29cea6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"e29cea6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"https:\/\/citruscapital.ca\/contact-us\/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Book a Meeting<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Financial Leadership We understand that financial statements and spreadsheets can be overwhelming and aren\u2019t for everyone! Fortunately, our team specializes in creating easy-to-interpret data analytics focused on improving your profitability and overall commercialization for better decision making. An example of services we can provide: Develop and execute financial budgets and plans Establish and monitor KPIs [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":7,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"site-sidebar-layout":"no-sidebar","site-content-layout":"page-builder","ast-site-content-layout":"default","site-content-style":"default","site-sidebar-style":"default","ast-global-header-display":"","ast-banner-title-visibility":"","ast-main-header-display":"","ast-hfb-above-header-display":"","ast-hfb-below-header-display":"","ast-hfb-mobile-header-display":"","site-post-title":"disabled","ast-breadcrumbs-content":"","ast-featured-img":"disabled","footer-sml-layout":"","ast-disable-related-posts":"","theme-transparent-header-meta":"enabled","adv-header-id-meta":"","stick-header-meta":"","header-above-stick-meta":"","header-main-stick-meta":"","header-below-stick-meta":"","astra-migrate-meta-layouts":"default","ast-page-background-enabled":"default","ast-page-background-meta":{"desktop":{"background-color":"","background-image":"","background-repeat":"repeat